# Ordinary local development disables AI; no secrets are required.
# Copy to .dev.vars.local to opt into a compatible provider locally.
# For native Workers AI, use pnpm dev:server:ai after wrangler login.
# That command uses the Cloudflare defaults and makes real, metered calls.

# Optional OpenAI-compatible provider, including Vercel AI Gateway:
# LLM_PROVIDER=openai-compatible
# LLM_API_KEY=your-provider-key
# LLM_BASE_URL=https://ai-gateway.vercel.sh/v1
# LLM_MODEL=openai/gpt-4o-mini
# LLM_DAILY_CALL_LIMIT=240

# Server-side policy; omitted list preserves LLM_MODEL for legacy installations.
# LLM_ALLOWED_MODELS=@cf/meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct-fp8,@cf/meta/llama-3.2-3b-instruct,@cf/google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it,@cf/mistralai/mistral-small-3.1-24b-instruct,@cf/meta/llama-3.3-70b-instruct-fp8-fast,@cf/meta/llama-4-scout-17b-16e-instruct
# LLM_DEFAULT_MODEL=@cf/meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct-fp8
# For compatible providers, use that provider's IDs in both variables.
